(5269642, 767575, 102024, '<td valign="top">I''ve been starting at this photograph for a good 10+ minutes now and it is still just as beautiful.  At first I didn''t really like the post-processing on this, but it is actually beginning to grow on me.  The lighting is wonderful.  This image brings out so many thoughts that I have yet to formulate into words.  Needless to say, I like this.</td>', 'I''ve been starting at this photograph for a good 10+ minutes now and it is still just as beautiful.  At first I didn''t really like the post-processing on this, but it is actually beginning to grow on me.  The lighting is wonderful.  This image brings out so many thoughts that I have yet to formulate into words.  Needless to say, I like this.', '2009-02-23 00:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
