(5270612, 767466, 80904, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo. I think however that the white background color not being highlighted/bright enough might cost you some points. <br/> <br/>Another thing that might cost you is the lack of sharpness on the roosters. <br/> <br/>Try a version of this in Black and white. It might stand out more since there is not much color to this photo.<br/> <br/>It is framed very nice and the DOF does blurr out the background well. <br/> <br/>I cannot vote on this since Greg told me this was yours, but I figured I would give you some input on what you could watch out for next time around on DPC (yeah they are a picky bunch). If I would have voted on it without knowing it was yours I would have given it a 5</td>', 'This is a good photo. I think however that the white background color not being highlighted/bright enough might cost you some points.  Another thing that might cost you is the lack of sharpness on the roosters.  Try a version of this in Black and white. It might stand out more since there is not much color to this photo. It is framed very nice and the DOF does blurr out the background well.  I cannot vote on this since Greg told me this was yours, but I figured I would give you some input on what you could watch out for next time around on DPC (yeah they are a picky bunch). If I would have voted on it without knowing it was yours I would have given it a 5', '2009-02-23 13:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5270614, 767422, 98339, '<td valign="top">I am on the fence with your shot...I really like it, but the colors are almost to much...love the boat with the bridge</td>', 'I am on the fence with your shot...I really like it, but the colors are almost to much...love the boat with the bridge', '2009-02-23 13:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
