(5271469, 767594, 103142, '<td valign="top">lovely.</td>', 'lovely.', '2009-02-23 21:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271475, 766509, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun shot--tells a nice story. (plus I wish it was warm enough here to do that!)<br/> <br/>I''d be tempted to take down the highlights in the water a tad more. Also, if this was a set shot, I''d move the boat down farther in the frame to balance all the dark trees. (if you just happened on the shot, good capture!)</td>', 'Fun shot--tells a nice story. (plus I wish it was warm enough here to do that!) I''d be tempted to take down the highlights in the water a tad more. Also, if this was a set shot, I''d move the boat down farther in the frame to balance all the dark trees. (if you just happened on the shot, good capture!)', '2009-02-23 21:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271476, 767431, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene. I''m curious what it would look like cropped in a little more, especially since you''re cutting off the top of the front right tree anyway, it seems that the extra sky and trees don''t add that much and the broken building is so interesting.</td>', 'Wonderful scene. I''m curious what it would look like cropped in a little more, especially since you''re cutting off the top of the front right tree anyway, it seems that the extra sky and trees don''t add that much and the broken building is so interesting.', '2009-02-23 21:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271477, 766468, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Seems a little oversaturated in the blues...</td>', 'Nice shot. Seems a little oversaturated in the blues...', '2009-02-23 21:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271478, 767506, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice penguin--cool birds.</td>', 'nice penguin--cool birds.', '2009-02-23 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271479, 767389, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice job. the sun seems a little bright to me, (and that could very well be because I have a headache at the moment, so take it with a grain of salt) but I especially like the shadow coming toward me.</td>', 'Nice job. the sun seems a little bright to me, (and that could very well be because I have a headache at the moment, so take it with a grain of salt) but I especially like the shadow coming toward me.', '2009-02-23 21:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271481, 767504, 103142, '<td valign="top">Clever. But I didn''t get a warning that there was nudity in this shot! :)</td>', 'Clever. But I didn''t get a warning that there was nudity in this shot! :)', '2009-02-23 21:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271482, 767529, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2009-02-23 21:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271486, 767215, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the setting, but the shadows seem to make it too busy. Actually, it might be the combination of the shadows and the tree/leaves. Perhaps try a closer crop, getting rid of the tree and staying with the tables, door &amp; shadows. I think it would look cleaner.</td>', 'I love the setting, but the shadows seem to make it too busy. Actually, it might be the combination of the shadows and the tree/leaves. Perhaps try a closer crop, getting rid of the tree and staying with the tables, door & shadows. I think it would look cleaner.', '2009-02-23 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271487, 766076, 103142, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too close to me. I''d be interested to see what it looked like a little farther out. (It was odd, but I had to move back to really focus on it. )</td>', 'Seems a little too close to me. I''d be interested to see what it looked like a little farther out. (It was odd, but I had to move back to really focus on it. )', '2009-02-23 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271488, 766641, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Another one that makes me feel cold!</td>', 'Nice shot. Another one that makes me feel cold!', '2009-02-23 21:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271489, 767144, 103142, '<td valign="top">Seems too over saturated with the pinks. It''s an amazing sky, but the extreme pink in the water is a little off-putting</td>', 'Seems too over saturated with the pinks. It''s an amazing sky, but the extreme pink in the water is a little off-putting', '2009-02-23 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271490, 767466, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun &amp; clever idea. I brought it into photoshop to play a little, and I''d recommend selecting the background and lightening it to almost a white. I think keeping the background white, or perhaps using a softer brown/beige for a backdrop would make it stronger. The grey tone doesn''t work as well with the wonderful browns in the rooster.</td>', 'Fun & clever idea. I brought it into photoshop to play a little, and I''d recommend selecting the background and lightening it to almost a white. I think keeping the background white, or perhaps using a softer brown/beige for a backdrop would make it stronger. The grey tone doesn''t work as well with the wonderful browns in the rooster.', '2009-02-23 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271491, 767399, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the scene. Since it''s advanced challenge, I''d play with the shadow/highlights option a little more though, bringing up the flowers &amp; down the lighting in the trees.</td>', 'I love the scene. Since it''s advanced challenge, I''d play with the shadow/highlights option a little more though, bringing up the flowers & down the lighting in the trees.', '2009-02-23 21:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271493, 767397, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the light coming through the flowers. However, I think the front two could have benefited with a little of fill light. They just aren''t as strong as the rest of the picture. It also would be interesting with a little more black background and placed off center. Your yellow and black combination is very effective.</td>', 'I like the idea of the light coming through the flowers. However, I think the front two could have benefited with a little of fill light. They just aren''t as strong as the rest of the picture. It also would be interesting with a little more black background and placed off center. Your yellow and black combination is very effective.', '2009-02-23 21:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271494, 767045, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the shot very much, but the red doesn''t seem to have anything to do with the shot, and lessens the beautiful blue/green background. Even if it had been someplace else in the picture, I think it would have been stronger than right behind the white flower. It immediately pulls my eye away.</td>', 'I like the shot very much, but the red doesn''t seem to have anything to do with the shot, and lessens the beautiful blue/green background. Even if it had been someplace else in the picture, I think it would have been stronger than right behind the white flower. It immediately pulls my eye away.', '2009-02-23 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271496, 767060, 103142, '<td valign="top">cute. I would have liked a like more depth of field to have the whiskers sharper. I don''t mind softness elsewhere--it fits with the picture. But sharp whiskers would feel better.</td>', 'cute. I would have liked a like more depth of field to have the whiskers sharper. I don''t mind softness elsewhere--it fits with the picture. But sharp whiskers would feel better.', '2009-02-23 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271497, 766519, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. The tree is a little too intrusive. I think I''d like the shot better shifted to the right so that the tree was more of a frame than a third of the picture.</td>', 'Nice scene. The tree is a little too intrusive. I think I''d like the shot better shifted to the right so that the tree was more of a frame than a third of the picture.', '2009-02-23 21:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271500, 766882, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice flowers. I like the little open spot in the upper left. Would have been nice to have one more open spot somewhere. Having everything else fill the frame makes that corner look like an accident. A little softening would be nice.</td>', 'Nice flowers. I like the little open spot in the upper left. Would have been nice to have one more open spot somewhere. Having everything else fill the frame makes that corner look like an accident. A little softening would be nice.', '2009-02-23 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271501, 767084, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice bridge. I''d try taking the highlights and the midtones down a little--it seems bright.</td>', 'Nice bridge. I''d try taking the highlights and the midtones down a little--it seems bright.', '2009-02-23 21:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271502, 767479, 103142, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a little more DOP and try a little sharper focus. wonderful colors.</td>', 'I would like to see a little more DOP and try a little sharper focus. wonderful colors.', '2009-02-23 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271503, 767470, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think the white background makes it a little less interesting. The grey coming in on the corners is a little distracting--it pulls your eyes to the corners.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think the white background makes it a little less interesting. The grey coming in on the corners is a little distracting--it pulls your eyes to the corners.', '2009-02-23 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271504, 767136, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the focal point is supposed to be in this picture. I like the sky very much, the blue vs the grey, but then the tree pulls my eyes, and then I notice the things in the lower right. I think they weaken the shot quite a bit. I''d be tempted to crop between the left two branches of the trees and a little off the top of the sky. I think it would be a stronger shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the focal point is supposed to be in this picture. I like the sky very much, the blue vs the grey, but then the tree pulls my eyes, and then I notice the things in the lower right. I think they weaken the shot quite a bit. I''d be tempted to crop between the left two branches of the trees and a little off the top of the sky. I think it would be a stronger shot.', '2009-02-23 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271507, 767417, 103142, '<td valign="top">It seems a little busy with the flowers off to the upper right and the pink in the upper left. Perhaps you could have isolated the daffodils a little more.</td>', 'It seems a little busy with the flowers off to the upper right and the pink in the upper left. Perhaps you could have isolated the daffodils a little more.', '2009-02-23 21:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271508, 767546, 103142, '<td valign="top">The tree in the upper left seems very intrusive, and blocks a nice view of the mountains behind. Is it possible to have lowered the camera to have the tree simply framing the upper corner instead of coming down so far?</td>', 'The tree in the upper left seems very intrusive, and blocks a nice view of the mountains behind. Is it possible to have lowered the camera to have the tree simply framing the upper corner instead of coming down so far?', '2009-02-23 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271509, 767051, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of backlighting flowers, but I''m not convinced that it works with this shot. I like it on the flowers themselves, but it makes the leaves very jumbled and messy looking. Perhaps backlighting the flowers, but adding some front lighting low for the leaves?</td>', 'I like the idea of backlighting flowers, but I''m not convinced that it works with this shot. I like it on the flowers themselves, but it makes the leaves very jumbled and messy looking. Perhaps backlighting the flowers, but adding some front lighting low for the leaves?', '2009-02-23 21:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271510, 767170, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the title--but the highlights seem too far blown. I''d try adjusting the levels...</td>', 'I like the title--but the highlights seem too far blown. I''d try adjusting the levels...', '2009-02-23 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271514, 767449, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  What IS that think balancing on the roof????  Love the colors, the wide angle accentuated by the horizon, the contrast of colors and textures of the roof against the snow.  Great job.  Just wonder a bit about why the center of the house (where the stone meets the snow) seems darker than the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  What IS that think balancing on the roof????  Love the colors, the wide angle accentuated by the horizon, the contrast of colors and textures of the roof against the snow.  Great job.  Just wonder a bit about why the center of the house (where the stone meets the snow) seems darker than the rest of the shot.', '2009-02-23 21:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271517, 766882, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers, but lacks a central point for me.  Also, the light seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers, but lacks a central point for me.  Also, the light seems a bit flat.', '2009-02-23 21:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271518, 767342, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice mood shot, though there is too much rushing water for me.   A more rectangular crop with less blurred water would have improved the proportions and accentuated the horizon.  Also, this doesn''t necessarily say "January" to me, although it''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'Nice mood shot, though there is too much rushing water for me.   A more rectangular crop with less blurred water would have improved the proportions and accentuated the horizon.  Also, this doesn''t necessarily say "January" to me, although it''s a lovely shot.', '2009-02-23 21:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271519, 767290, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks like you caught him doing something naughty.</td>', 'Looks like you caught him doing something naughty.', '2009-02-23 21:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271521, 767413, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and shapes.</td>', 'Lovely tones and shapes.', '2009-02-23 21:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271523, 766020, 96751, '<td valign="top">Precious little girl, great colors and textures.  But whether or not by design, those eyelashes just kill this for me.  Don''t know if they''re fake or mascara, or pp''d somehow, but because they are so prominent and harsh, they make the shot all about the lashes, especially with the softening of the skin around them..</td>', 'Precious little girl, great colors and textures.  But whether or not by design, those eyelashes just kill this for me.  Don''t know if they''re fake or mascara, or pp''d somehow, but because they are so prominent and harsh, they make the shot all about the lashes, especially with the softening of the skin around them..', '2009-02-23 21:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271525, 767229, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the two turkeys in this.  The one in the front is amazing, incredible detail in the feathers.  The second one is  too far left and too far back so it throws off the composition.  I think a vertical crop with just the right bird might have been stronger.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the two turkeys in this.  The one in the front is amazing, incredible detail in the feathers.  The second one is  too far left and too far back so it throws off the composition.  I think a vertical crop with just the right bird might have been stronger.', '2009-02-23 21:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271526, 767013, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though beautiful flowers, the color is just too oversaturated for my taste.</td>', 'Though beautiful flowers, the color is just too oversaturated for my taste.', '2009-02-23 21:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271527, 767295, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  If only the sun was further forward to light his face instead of his back.  It would also have helped reduce the harsh shadow on the rock to the left.</td>', 'Great subject!  If only the sun was further forward to light his face instead of his back.  It would also have helped reduce the harsh shadow on the rock to the left.', '2009-02-23 21:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271528, 767184, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot.  What a gorgeous animal, and excellent detail on the fur and eyes.</td>', 'Fabulous shot.  What a gorgeous animal, and excellent detail on the fur and eyes.', '2009-02-23 21:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271529, 767232, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fairyland!</td>', 'Looks like a fairyland!', '2009-02-23 21:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271530, 767535, 96751, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely.</td>', 'Simple and lovely.', '2009-02-23 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271535, 767339, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, interesting subject.  The branch is the perfect angle to make this more visually interesting.  The background colors, unfortunately, do not help the subject stand out.  Perhaps if they had been adjusted to a slightly more contrasted color, the bird would have "popped" more.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, interesting subject.  The branch is the perfect angle to make this more visually interesting.  The background colors, unfortunately, do not help the subject stand out.  Perhaps if they had been adjusted to a slightly more contrasted color, the bird would have "popped" more.', '2009-02-23 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271538, 767575, 96751, '<td valign="top">Front page stuff for me!  Just awesome.  Great prep and execution.   Terrific lighting and contrast.  The wrinkles and sheen on the skin is killer.</td>', 'Front page stuff for me!  Just awesome.  Great prep and execution.   Terrific lighting and contrast.  The wrinkles and sheen on the skin is killer.', '2009-02-23 21:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271540, 767338, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible eyes.  Background green is a bit too harsh and draws my eye from the main subject.</td>', 'Incredible eyes.  Background green is a bit too harsh and draws my eye from the main subject.', '2009-02-23 21:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271542, 766956, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible picture.  Don''t know that it says "February" though...  But it would sure make a great calendar page.</td>', 'Incredible picture.  Don''t know that it says "February" though...  But it would sure make a great calendar page.', '2009-02-23 21:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271545, 765938, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  The lighting is a bit off for me - a bit overexposed on the highlights of the ur.</td>', 'Too cute.  The lighting is a bit off for me - a bit overexposed on the highlights of the ur.', '2009-02-23 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271548, 767526, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Great colors.  A bit unfocused on the flower.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Great colors.  A bit unfocused on the flower.', '2009-02-23 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271549, 767389, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice star burst.  The detail in the smallest branches is a bit blurred.</td>', 'Nice star burst.  The detail in the smallest branches is a bit blurred.', '2009-02-23 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271550, 767347, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice still life.</td>', 'Nice still life.', '2009-02-23 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271552, 767372, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think the sky is over-treated here, and seems really harsh against the sand.</td>', 'I think the sky is over-treated here, and seems really harsh against the sand.', '2009-02-23 21:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271555, 767601, 96751, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m just not a fan of highly processed shots.  This could have been so much stronger with natural lighting, or some d&amp;b to highlight some of the headstones.  The halo above the trees is distracting.</td>', 'I guess I''m just not a fan of highly processed shots.  This could have been so much stronger with natural lighting, or some d&b to highlight some of the headstones.  The halo above the trees is distracting.', '2009-02-23 21:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271556, 767569, 96751, '<td valign="top">Quite a storm!  I wish the cattle (?) in the foreground had been lightened a bit; they are barely visible.</td>', 'Quite a storm!  I wish the cattle (?) in the foreground had been lightened a bit; they are barely visible.', '2009-02-23 21:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271564, 766017, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Great painting-like quality to this shot.  I love the lighting o her face and arm, but wish it had been softer on the white skirt.  Still, top quality work.</td>', 'I love this.  Great painting-like quality to this shot.  I love the lighting o her face and arm, but wish it had been softer on the white skirt.  Still, top quality work.', '2009-02-23 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271566, 767060, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  But I wish the focus had been more on the bunny than on the hat.</td>', 'Too cute.  But I wish the focus had been more on the bunny than on the hat.', '2009-02-23 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271569, 766880, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflection shot.  Great detail in the branches.</td>', 'Awesome reflection shot.  Great detail in the branches.', '2009-02-23 22:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271573, 767525, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!  The car at the very back probably has no idea why they''re moving at a waddle.  10 for content, but the quality of the shot is rather snapshot.</td>', 'LOL!!!!  The car at the very back probably has no idea why they''re moving at a waddle.  10 for content, but the quality of the shot is rather snapshot.', '2009-02-23 22:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271575, 767537, 96751, '<td valign="top">Something about the islands is a bit odd.  Compared to the depth of the water, the sky, and the coast, they seem oddly flat and untextured.</td>', 'Something about the islands is a bit odd.  Compared to the depth of the water, the sky, and the coast, they seem oddly flat and untextured.', '2009-02-23 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271577, 766372, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the rose shot.  The lighting and detail are wonderful.</td>', 'Nice take on the rose shot.  The lighting and detail are wonderful.', '2009-02-23 22:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271582, 767449, 98771, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The contrast of the stone against pale background is nice.</td>', 'I like this very much. The contrast of the stone against pale background is nice.', '2009-02-23 22:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271584, 766941, 98771, '<td valign="top">Nice!! Truly would fit in a calendar. Well done.</td>', 'Nice!! Truly would fit in a calendar. Well done.', '2009-02-23 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271596, 766115, 79955, '<td valign="top">cool shot!!! Love the streak in the sky , 8</td>', 'cool shot!!! Love the streak in the sky , 8', '2009-02-23 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
