(5271643, 767524, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract. I give this a Posthumous Yellow.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Wonderful abstract. I give this a Posthumous Yellow. ', '2009-02-23 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271644, 767293, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous integration of life and art, with a humorous twist. I give this my red ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Gorgeous integration of life and art, with a humorous twist. I give this my red ribbon. ', '2009-02-23 23:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271645, 767029, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. What music!</td>', 'Beautiful. What music!', '2009-02-23 23:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271669, 767591, 51379, '<td valign="top">This is very well done and more appropriate for a calendar than some in this challenge. Great choice of colors it pops very well. The only thing is the amount of water droplets I think they are too small or there are too many to look natural. 8 from me. Good luck</td>', 'This is very well done and more appropriate for a calendar than some in this challenge. Great choice of colors it pops very well. The only thing is the amount of water droplets I think they are too small or there are too many to look natural. 8 from me. Good luck', '2009-02-23 23:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271705, 767480, 96751, '<td valign="top">A shot that is likely to be underrated.  I went past it and something caught my eye.  I think the content is stellar - love the ice-encased twigs.  But I think the lighting is substandard, making it easy to miss the prize on the inside.</td>', 'A shot that is likely to be underrated.  I went past it and something caught my eye.  I think the content is stellar - love the ice-encased twigs.  But I think the lighting is substandard, making it easy to miss the prize on the inside.', '2009-02-24 01:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271706, 767415, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  And I am mystified by those perfect snow bumps.  I think the color adjustment may be too green - the sky is an odd teal color.  It makes for an interesting shot, but a weird sky.</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  And I am mystified by those perfect snow bumps.  I think the color adjustment may be too green - the sky is an odd teal color.  It makes for an interesting shot, but a weird sky.', '2009-02-24 01:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271707, 767185, 96751, '<td valign="top">And then they announce the White challenge....  Very sweet.  High awww factor.  A tad washed out for my picky sensibilities :-)</td>', 'And then they announce the White challenge....  Very sweet.  High awww factor.  A tad washed out for my picky sensibilities :-)', '2009-02-24 01:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271708, 766934, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot.  Not sure if this is calendar material though.</td>', 'Nice clean shot.  Not sure if this is calendar material though.', '2009-02-24 01:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271709, 767096, 96751, '<td valign="top">Top 10 for me so far.  GREAT concept, nicely done, although the legs might be just a tad overexposed.  I think the total lack of shadow or contour makes this shot less dynamic than it could be with some added depth.</td>', 'Top 10 for me so far.  GREAT concept, nicely done, although the legs might be just a tad overexposed.  I think the total lack of shadow or contour makes this shot less dynamic than it could be with some added depth.', '2009-02-24 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271711, 767478, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice strong shot of the boat.  The background building, not so much.  Whatever processing you did on the boat and rocks, well, rocks!!!  Even the sky is nicely dramatized (I can even forgive the "halo" where the deck and the wheelhouse meet).  But the way grass and the background structure appear to be left untouched really detracts from an otherwise very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice strong shot of the boat.  The background building, not so much.  Whatever processing you did on the boat and rocks, well, rocks!!!  Even the sky is nicely dramatized (I can even forgive the "halo" where the deck and the wheelhouse meet).  But the way grass and the background structure appear to be left untouched really detracts from an otherwise very nice shot.', '2009-02-24 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271714, 766228, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that the over saturation makes this a better shot.  This looks like the sky could have been great without any help.</td>', 'I don''t know that the over saturation makes this a better shot.  This looks like the sky could have been great without any help.', '2009-02-24 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271715, 767539, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great b/w.  Nice detail, depth, contrast, sharpness.  Sure looks like a November sky to me...</td>', 'Great b/w.  Nice detail, depth, contrast, sharpness.  Sure looks like a November sky to me...', '2009-02-24 01:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271716, 767079, 53814, '<td valign="top">a beautiful composition in motion - 10</td>', 'a beautiful composition in motion - 10', '2009-02-24 01:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271717, 767242, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the sky a lot more than the water.</td>', 'I love the sky a lot more than the water.', '2009-02-24 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271719, 766841, 96751, '<td valign="top">Where is this incredible place???!!!!!  I''d like to say that I love the photo as much as the subject, but I find the lighting is more interesting on the cliffs in the background than on the subject itself.  A real pity because this could have been awesome.  Perhaps some d&amp;b might have brought out the detail more.</td>', 'Where is this incredible place???!!!!!  I''d like to say that I love the photo as much as the subject, but I find the lighting is more interesting on the cliffs in the background than on the subject itself.  A real pity because this could have been awesome.  Perhaps some d&b might have brought out the detail more.', '2009-02-24 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271720, 767593, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those sure are some long horns....  The shapes made by the horns, and the color contrast of the two bulls is really interesting, while the lighting is not.</td>', 'Those sure are some long horns....  The shapes made by the horns, and the color contrast of the two bulls is really interesting, while the lighting is not.', '2009-02-24 01:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271721, 767430, 96751, '<td valign="top">A typical calendar shot!  Nice work on the water bead details, although the highlights on the left are a tad bit contrasty.</td>', 'A typical calendar shot!  Nice work on the water bead details, although the highlights on the left are a tad bit contrasty.', '2009-02-24 01:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271723, 767397, 96751, '<td valign="top">VERY cool.  LOVE the backlit daffodils.  This shot as really great depth and very interesting texture.  The vase below, though very dark, still maintains great textures, in contrast with the dark, surrounding negative space.  The flowers on the left of the image are just a tiny bit oversaturated, but I think this actually improves the color variety in the shot.</td>', 'VERY cool.  LOVE the backlit daffodils.  This shot as really great depth and very interesting texture.  The vase below, though very dark, still maintains great textures, in contrast with the dark, surrounding negative space.  The flowers on the left of the image are just a tiny bit oversaturated, but I think this actually improves the color variety in the shot.', '2009-02-24 01:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271724, 767610, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, although it''s too dark for "July".  It feels more wintery because of the lighting.  Nice dof and textures.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, although it''s too dark for "July".  It feels more wintery because of the lighting.  Nice dof and textures.', '2009-02-24 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271725, 767360, 96751, '<td valign="top">That is one wet worm.  He looks pissed off.  Really great macro.  Although I think showers are in April :-)</td>', 'That is one wet worm.  He looks pissed off.  Really great macro.  Although I think showers are in April :-)', '2009-02-24 01:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271726, 767471, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something very Zen about this shot.  Lovely blue tones, gorgeous shape with the bird.  Nice balance with the horizon.</td>', 'There is something very Zen about this shot.  Lovely blue tones, gorgeous shape with the bird.  Nice balance with the horizon.', '2009-02-24 01:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271727, 767550, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture.  The b/w, the shadows, very textured lighting on the leaf and the background.  A real standout for me.</td>', 'Gorgeous picture.  The b/w, the shadows, very textured lighting on the leaf and the background.  A real standout for me.', '2009-02-24 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271728, 767220, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great reflection!</td>', 'Great reflection!', '2009-02-24 01:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271729, 767575, 53814, '<td valign="top">Gravity gets us all eventually...<br/>The processing/color choices makes me think this might be Skew''s. I particularly love the eyes and the artist''s sig at the bottom right.<br/>Exceptional.</td>', 'Gravity gets us all eventually...The processing/color choices makes me think this might be Skew''s. I particularly love the eyes and the artist''s sig at the bottom right.Exceptional.', '2009-02-24 01:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271730, 767591, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice work on the flower.  I think the proportions are a bit off between the flower and the vase, and I''m not sure about the cropping.  But the colors are very interesting.</td>', 'Very nice work on the flower.  I think the proportions are a bit off between the flower and the vase, and I''m not sure about the cropping.  But the colors are very interesting.', '2009-02-24 01:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271731, 767594, 96751, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are shouting SPRING!!!!  The lighting on the background is really terrific, and the intentional seam is also good.  But I feel that the flowers themselves could have benefited from a touch of light or d&amp;b.  They''re kind of secondary to the background right now.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are shouting SPRING!!!!  The lighting on the background is really terrific, and the intentional seam is also good.  But I feel that the flowers themselves could have benefited from a touch of light or d&b.  They''re kind of secondary to the background right now.', '2009-02-24 01:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271732, 767079, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2009-02-24 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271734, 766948, 96751, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that this is a good shot for a calendar, but there is something very eerie and interesting about it.  I love the color, but am undecided as to whether the writing is distracting or enhancing.</td>', 'Don''t know that this is a good shot for a calendar, but there is something very eerie and interesting about it.  I love the color, but am undecided as to whether the writing is distracting or enhancing.', '2009-02-24 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271737, 767292, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  I had to really focus my eyes to see this shot.  Especially because the previous one was really bright!!  I think this may have been a really great photograph, but it has been processed to the point of becoming a painting or digital "art".</td>', 'Hmmmm.  I had to really focus my eyes to see this shot.  Especially because the previous one was really bright!!  I think this may have been a really great photograph, but it has been processed to the point of becoming a painting or digital "art".', '2009-02-24 01:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271738, 767536, 42013, '<td valign="top">my .02...<br/> <br/>It looks like you may have shot this from a bridge. Something to think about... With wider angle shots, it is important to draw in the viewer, give them a real feel for the place. We can''t hear the water or feel the cold so visually you need to stimulate those senses. The framing here doesn''t give me  a real sense of what you were seeing/feeling. I''m sure you didn''t want wet feet but maybe you could have scrambled down to the side of the river to change the perspective. It''s a gray winter day so there isn''t a lot of drama unless you put the viewer''s feet in the water! Make them cold! :)</td>', 'my .02... It looks like you may have shot this from a bridge. Something to think about... With wider angle shots, it is important to draw in the viewer, give them a real feel for the place. We can''t hear the water or feel the cold so visually you need to stimulate those senses. The framing here doesn''t give me  a real sense of what you were seeing/feeling. I''m sure you didn''t want wet feet but maybe you could have scrambled down to the side of the river to change the perspective. It''s a gray winter day so there isn''t a lot of drama unless you put the viewer''s feet in the water! Make them cold! :)', '2009-02-24 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271739, 767604, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, is this somebody''s model?  I swear I''ve seen this guy before.  Amazing detail on the feathers.  Love the directional lighting, the very subdued colors, the red at the tip of his beak.</td>', 'Ok, is this somebody''s model?  I swear I''ve seen this guy before.  Amazing detail on the feathers.  Love the directional lighting, the very subdued colors, the red at the tip of his beak.', '2009-02-24 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271743, 766076, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s Ms. Bzzzz to you!  If those really big round things are it''s eyes, what''s the red dot in the center...????  Creepy cool.</td>', 'That''s Ms. Bzzzz to you!  If those really big round things are it''s eyes, what''s the red dot in the center...????  Creepy cool.', '2009-02-24 01:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271744, 766864, 42013, '<td valign="top">July is about vacation and freedom! this makes me feel kinda confined. it''s beachy but leaves me wanting more...</td>', 'July is about vacation and freedom! this makes me feel kinda confined. it''s beachy but leaves me wanting more...', '2009-02-24 01:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271745, 766941, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT perspective of Golden Gate.  Where is this?  Impressive wide angle, great lines with the foam and the clouds, although the bridge is almost lost.  Would have loved to have the red brought out just a little more.</td>', 'GREAT perspective of Golden Gate.  Where is this?  Impressive wide angle, great lines with the foam and the clouds, although the bridge is almost lost.  Would have loved to have the red brought out just a little more.', '2009-02-24 01:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271746, 767508, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up.  But the ball''s too clean :-)</td>', 'Nice close-up.  But the ball''s too clean :-)', '2009-02-24 01:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271747, 767111, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2009-02-24 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271748, 767525, 42013, '<td valign="top">ing along. :)</td>', 'ing along. :)', '2009-02-24 01:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271749, 767058, 96751, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!  The blue background really enhances his tawny fur.  Great dof.</td>', 'How beautiful!  The blue background really enhances his tawny fur.  Great dof.', '2009-02-24 01:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271750, 767516, 42013, '<td valign="top">A grand old lady. Totally iconic photo. good luck!</td>', 'A grand old lady. Totally iconic photo. good luck!', '2009-02-24 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271751, 767516, 96751, '<td valign="top">The vignetting really makes this shot better.  Love all the different lines of the wood slats, and the different textures of the upper floor, and the grass.  Very appealing image.</td>', 'The vignetting really makes this shot better.  Love all the different lines of the wood slats, and the different textures of the upper floor, and the grass.  Very appealing image.', '2009-02-24 01:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271752, 766739, 42013, '<td valign="top">June!? She looks more like April to me... ;)</td>', 'June!? She looks more like April to me... ;)', '2009-02-24 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271753, 767146, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although the wind-swept snow is really great, I find the image a bit flat.  The composition is really nice, very symmetrical, in shapes and colors.  Just the mountain is kind of flat against the sky.</td>', 'Although the wind-swept snow is really great, I find the image a bit flat.  The composition is really nice, very symmetrical, in shapes and colors.  Just the mountain is kind of flat against the sky.', '2009-02-24 01:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271754, 767575, 42013, '<td valign="top">so frikkin funny! Why don''t you make an entire calender out of apple heads? I think it would be a hot seller.</td>', 'so frikkin funny! Why don''t you make an entire calender out of apple heads? I think it would be a hot seller.', '2009-02-24 01:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271755, 767216, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool treatment of one of my favorite flowers.  The contrast really pops this bloom.</td>', 'Very cool treatment of one of my favorite flowers.  The contrast really pops this bloom.', '2009-02-24 01:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271776, 767219, 49109, '<td valign="top">seems oversaturated to me. had preferred to have he blown sky cropped off. the OOF branches at right distract slightly</td>', 'seems oversaturated to me. had preferred to have he blown sky cropped off. the OOF branches at right distract slightly', '2009-02-24 02:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271777, 767576, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall abit pale. the border is too bold for my taste</td>', 'overall abit pale. the border is too bold for my taste', '2009-02-24 02:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271779, 765962, 49109, '<td valign="top">DOF is too shallow, the top of the ring is out of focus. composition could be enhanced by cropping off about 1/5 at right</td>', 'DOF is too shallow, the top of the ring is out of focus. composition could be enhanced by cropping off about 1/5 at right', '2009-02-24 02:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271780, 767342, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent focus  and exposure, nice moody color. too much of the soft water in foreground IMO</td>', 'excellent focus  and exposure, nice moody color. too much of the soft water in foreground IMO', '2009-02-24 02:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271784, 766372, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good focus, good composition. a less dull background had enhanced the image. border is too playful.</td>', 'very good focus, good composition. a less dull background had enhanced the image. border is too playful.', '2009-02-24 03:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271785, 766934, 49109, '<td valign="top">good shot and processing, but the sensor dust is very annoying</td>', 'good shot and processing, but the sensor dust is very annoying', '2009-02-24 03:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271786, 767458, 49109, '<td valign="top">looks like a winner - perfectly composed and exposed, great color, just before being too strong</td>', 'looks like a winner - perfectly composed and exposed, great color, just before being too strong', '2009-02-24 03:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271788, 767429, 49109, '<td valign="top">you didn''t have to mention summer, I liked the idea that it was snow</td>', 'you didn''t have to mention summer, I liked the idea that it was snow', '2009-02-24 03:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271843, 767508, 18655, '<td valign="top">Is April baseball month? I guess you have to be North American and a baseball fan to appreciate this particular picture on a calendar. But it could of course be a sports calendar. Regardless: I will of course not deduct any points for this.<br/>Nice picture though - very sharp.</td>', 'Is April baseball month? I guess you have to be North American and a baseball fan to appreciate this particular picture on a calendar. But it could of course be a sports calendar. Regardless: I will of course not deduct any points for this.Nice picture though - very sharp.', '2009-02-24 06:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271844, 766841, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The light and sharpness gives it a 3-d effect. Would have been nice if you also had managed to get the cliffs in full focus but that''s only to be picky.</td>', 'Very nice! The light and sharpness gives it a 3-d effect. Would have been nice if you also had managed to get the cliffs in full focus but that''s only to be picky.', '2009-02-24 06:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5271845, 767601, 89230, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. It seems a bit overprocessed though. I really like the lines of tombstones and the vanishing points. The main issue that I have an issue with this, and I bet many people have more of a problem than I do, is the halo over the trees. In the future, maybe try:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=80</td>', 'Very nice photo. It seems a bit overprocessed though. I really like the lines of tombstones and the vanishing points. The main issue that I have an issue with this, and I bet many people have more of a problem than I do, is the halo over the trees. In the future, maybe try://www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=80', '2009-02-24 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
