(5272984, 766017, 103142, '<td valign="top">Beautifully set. The pose is looking a little awkward. If she were really looking at flowers, she wouldn''t hold them so far down. It also closes her eyes to much. I''d consider bending her elbow and raising up the flowers a little. I think it would look more natural, and you''d have the eyes open a tad more. <br/> <br/>Wonderful lighting and colors!</td>', 'Beautifully set. The pose is looking a little awkward. If she were really looking at flowers, she wouldn''t hold them so far down. It also closes her eyes to much. I''d consider bending her elbow and raising up the flowers a little. I think it would look more natural, and you''d have the eyes open a tad more.  Wonderful lighting and colors!', '2009-02-24 22:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272985, 767422, 103142, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some strange things going on in the sand--appears like a lot of digital noise, and over saturated. I like the bridge, trees, and sunset a lot, but I think the boat and the shore weaken it significantly.</td>', 'You''ve got some strange things going on in the sand--appears like a lot of digital noise, and over saturated. I like the bridge, trees, and sunset a lot, but I think the boat and the shore weaken it significantly.', '2009-02-24 22:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272986, 767601, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like it quite a bit. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like it quite a bit. Well done.', '2009-02-24 22:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272987, 767338, 90414, '<td valign="top">Crisp shot and beautiful bekeh. You captured those intense eyes well.</td>', 'Crisp shot and beautiful bekeh. You captured those intense eyes well.', '2009-02-24 22:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272990, 767521, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene--I especially like the tree covered hill/mountain. I don''t think that the partial house and the rooftops in the foreground add anything to the picture however. I''d be tempted to crop at the bottom of the church, even if you end up losing the left side of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice scene--I especially like the tree covered hill/mountain. I don''t think that the partial house and the rooftops in the foreground add anything to the picture however. I''d be tempted to crop at the bottom of the church, even if you end up losing the left side of the photo.', '2009-02-24 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272993, 765843, 103142, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2009-02-24 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272994, 767430, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like the colors and the cropping.</td>', 'Very nice! I like the colors and the cropping.', '2009-02-24 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272995, 767407, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the flag, but the rest looks very busy and the focus pretty soft. I would have liked to see an angle more to the left. Also I''d take down the highlights on the fountain. It looks overblown.</td>', 'I like the flag, but the rest looks very busy and the focus pretty soft. I would have liked to see an angle more to the left. Also I''d take down the highlights on the fountain. It looks overblown.', '2009-02-24 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272996, 767485, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nice. Crisp and clean.</td>', 'very nice. Crisp and clean.', '2009-02-24 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272998, 766228, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s so pretty, it''s a shame to see the culvert and the junk. Could you walk past it, or was that what you really wanted to show? Just curious...</td>', 'It''s so pretty, it''s a shame to see the culvert and the junk. Could you walk past it, or was that what you really wanted to show? Just curious...', '2009-02-24 22:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
