(5273002, 767569, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice clouds. I''d be tempted to make the foreground just a tad brighter. (I know the storm''s coming in, but it''s a wonderful foreground and it seems to disappear.</td>', 'Very nice clouds. I''d be tempted to make the foreground just a tad brighter. (I know the storm''s coming in, but it''s a wonderful foreground and it seems to disappear.', '2009-02-24 22:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
