(5273037, 767514, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I love all the stuff hanging from the tree. Reminds me of the Olympic rain forest.</td>', 'Fun shot. I love all the stuff hanging from the tree. Reminds me of the Olympic rain forest.', '2009-02-24 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273038, 766972, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I enjoyed it.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I enjoyed it.', '2009-02-24 22:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273040, 766882, 6519, '<td valign="top">What a lovely riot of color! I like how it fills the frame with all that cheerfulness.<br/> <br/>If I had to pick on something, I''d pick on the top left corner. I wish either the flowers totally filled the frame, or at least it was balanced better. Somehow, that corner just doesn''t look right.<br/> <br/>But the wonderful colors make up for it all, anyway  :-)</td>', 'What a lovely riot of color! I like how it fills the frame with all that cheerfulness. If I had to pick on something, I''d pick on the top left corner. I wish either the flowers totally filled the frame, or at least it was balanced better. Somehow, that corner just doesn''t look right. But the wonderful colors make up for it all, anyway  :-)', '2009-02-24 22:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273046, 767341, 6519, '<td valign="top">A classic shot with great colors, lines, composition, etc - love it!</td>', 'A classic shot with great colors, lines, composition, etc - love it!', '2009-02-24 22:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273048, 765962, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more interesting with the ring in color. Also, I would have liked a sharper focus on the top part of the ring. I don''t mind softness in a photo, but having that be the only soft part doesn''t work as well.</td>', 'I think it would have been more interesting with the ring in color. Also, I would have liked a sharper focus on the top part of the ring. I don''t mind softness in a photo, but having that be the only soft part doesn''t work as well.', '2009-02-24 22:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273050, 767508, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. I''d be curious to see it not quite so close in. (just a tad farther back)</td>', 'I like the shot. I''d be curious to see it not quite so close in. (just a tad farther back)', '2009-02-24 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273051, 767295, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like him!</td>', 'I like him!', '2009-02-24 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273052, 766956, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Though I''m curious as to why February.</td>', 'Fun shot. Though I''m curious as to why February.', '2009-02-24 22:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273053, 766882, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful riot of colors, but it has an over processed look. It certainly does say July.</td>', 'Beautiful riot of colors, but it has an over processed look. It certainly does say July.', '2009-02-24 22:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273055, 766888, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but two little statues on a black background just don''t float my boat. They look flat and boring.<br/>Little statues rarely do terribly well, but perhaps with some different lighting they might have looked a tad more interesting.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but two little statues on a black background just don''t float my boat. They look flat and boring.Little statues rarely do terribly well, but perhaps with some different lighting they might have looked a tad more interesting.', '2009-02-24 22:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273057, 767111, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, having it a little more from the side would make it more obvious. At quick glance, it wasn''t quite clear.</td>', 'Interesting idea, having it a little more from the side would make it more obvious. At quick glance, it wasn''t quite clear.', '2009-02-24 22:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273058, 766057, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice, though it seems a little oversaturated.</td>', 'Nice, though it seems a little oversaturated.', '2009-02-24 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273059, 767448, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.</td>', 'Fun shot.', '2009-02-24 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273060, 767353, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot--but then again, I''m very partial to these flowers!</td>', 'Nice shot--but then again, I''m very partial to these flowers!', '2009-02-24 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273062, 767232, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m curious about where you live. This looks like the Northeastern United States in June; I think most American calendars show a winter scene of some sort in February. That may be my cultural bias, I suppose, but I don''t feel February here.</td>', 'I''m curious about where you live. This looks like the Northeastern United States in June; I think most American calendars show a winter scene of some sort in February. That may be my cultural bias, I suppose, but I don''t feel February here.', '2009-02-24 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273063, 767355, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, I think it would have been stronger cropping out the row of yellow at the top, and having it not be so centered.</td>', 'Fun idea, I think it would have been stronger cropping out the row of yellow at the top, and having it not be so centered.', '2009-02-24 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273065, 767170, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but oh, those blown-out whites! IMHO it would have been better to let the leaves and yellow flowers go a bit dark to hold some detail in the whites.</td>', 'Nice composition, but oh, those blown-out whites! IMHO it would have been better to let the leaves and yellow flowers go a bit dark to hold some detail in the whites.', '2009-02-24 22:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273066, 766876, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm..... you have all sorts of lighting and post processing issues going on here.<br/>The background isn''t clean and there is NO visible detail in the black areas.<br/> <br/>More careful attention to the technicalities would have made this much better.</td>', 'Hmmmm..... you have all sorts of lighting and post processing issues going on here.The background isn''t clean and there is NO visible detail in the black areas. More careful attention to the technicalities would have made this much better.', '2009-02-24 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273068, 767485, 12733, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous cardinal, beautifully rendered. Somehow, I associate cardinals with spring and summer, not necessarily January. Calendar pictures are usually more about what''s typical of the season, not neccesarily the season in which it was taken.</td>', 'A gorgeous cardinal, beautifully rendered. Somehow, I associate cardinals with spring and summer, not necessarily January. Calendar pictures are usually more about what''s typical of the season, not neccesarily the season in which it was taken.', '2009-02-24 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273069, 767422, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, but I don''t care for the very strong saturation.</td>', 'I like the scene, but I don''t care for the very strong saturation.', '2009-02-24 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273070, 767186, 12733, '<td valign="top">And believe that with four inches of snow left from the last storm, I''m eating my heart out. After seven years in Wollongong and Melbourne, I wish I were in that scene. Nice shot; it captures the feeling of an Australian February.</td>', 'And believe that with four inches of snow left from the last storm, I''m eating my heart out. After seven years in Wollongong and Melbourne, I wish I were in that scene. Nice shot; it captures the feeling of an Australian February.', '2009-02-24 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273071, 767534, 6519, '<td valign="top">If only the flash wasn''t so very harsh!</td>', 'If only the flash wasn''t so very harsh!', '2009-02-24 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273073, 767586, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great seasonal symbol. I''m a little dubious about the out of focus confetti in the background, though.</td>', 'Great seasonal symbol. I''m a little dubious about the out of focus confetti in the background, though.', '2009-02-24 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273074, 767355, 6519, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers and nice DOF, but the composition could be more interesting.</td>', 'Pretty flowers and nice DOF, but the composition could be more interesting.', '2009-02-24 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273076, 767058, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great, the snow shows the season, and the fox is great.</td>', 'Great, the snow shows the season, and the fox is great.', '2009-02-24 23:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273078, 767022, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but that just looks chaotic and yellow.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but that just looks chaotic and yellow.', '2009-02-24 23:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273080, 766519, 12733, '<td valign="top">The branch would make a great frame, except that it encloses only a part of the shoreline and leaves out the refelction and larger body of water. Nice exposure, lighting and definition.</td>', 'The branch would make a great frame, except that it encloses only a part of the shoreline and leaves out the refelction and larger body of water. Nice exposure, lighting and definition.', '2009-02-24 23:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273081, 767399, 12733, '<td valign="top">A carpet of snowdrops, no less. Great shot, great location. I like the way the trees frame it.</td>', 'A carpet of snowdrops, no less. Great shot, great location. I like the way the trees frame it.', '2009-02-24 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273083, 766888, 12733, '<td valign="top">I guess I can see the relevance of the angels to December - Christmas - but it doesn''t hit me with a December theme. The rendition is good, if a bit too centered.</td>', 'I guess I can see the relevance of the angels to December - Christmas - but it doesn''t hit me with a December theme. The rendition is good, if a bit too centered.', '2009-02-24 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273087, 767292, 12733, '<td valign="top">The pastel effect is very April. In keeping with the rules on text in a picture, I won''t let it affect my score. I hope no one puts it in for a DQ - it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'The pastel effect is very April. In keeping with the rules on text in a picture, I won''t let it affect my score. I hope no one puts it in for a DQ - it''s a very nice shot.', '2009-02-24 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273093, 767341, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very summery and great colors. Nice to see this in February, when it''s 20 degrees with inches deep snow on the ground where I live.</td>', 'Very summery and great colors. Nice to see this in February, when it''s 20 degrees with inches deep snow on the ground where I live.', '2009-02-24 23:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273096, 767226, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns. and an interesting city skyline.</td>', 'Nice patterns. and an interesting city skyline.', '2009-02-24 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273098, 767600, 12733, '<td valign="top">Which month on the calendar is this picture going to illustrate? I suppose March for St. Patrick''s day, but it does leave one guessing. The placement of the glass makes a key word on the sign nearly unreadable!</td>', 'Which month on the calendar is this picture going to illustrate? I suppose March for St. Patrick''s day, but it does leave one guessing. The placement of the glass makes a key word on the sign nearly unreadable!', '2009-02-24 23:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273100, 767184, 73884, '<td valign="top">Good choice!</td>', 'Good choice!', '2009-02-24 23:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
