(5273129, 766739, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but June??? I like the expression enough to ignore the lack of calendar significance.</td>', 'Great shot, but June??? I like the expression enough to ignore the lack of calendar significance.', '2009-02-24 23:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273130, 767574, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty landscape. That barn looks very well maintained and makes a nice, clear subject.</td>', 'Very pretty landscape. That barn looks very well maintained and makes a nice, clear subject.', '2009-02-24 23:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273134, 767514, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting tree, but it seems a bit washed out on the right. It seems too early for sunset.</td>', 'Interesting tree, but it seems a bit washed out on the right. It seems too early for sunset.', '2009-02-24 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273138, 767507, 12733, '<td valign="top">It isn''t clear from the picture or the title what month this might fit into on a calendar. Sure, you could find a calendar topic that this lovely model would fit - but it isn''t clear which kind or what month. Sorry, it is a nice shot (though I don''t much like the background. And DNMC.</td>', 'It isn''t clear from the picture or the title what month this might fit into on a calendar. Sure, you could find a calendar topic that this lovely model would fit - but it isn''t clear which kind or what month. Sorry, it is a nice shot (though I don''t much like the background. And DNMC.', '2009-02-24 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273139, 766688, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the variety of green shades and the bright, even light.</td>', 'I love the variety of green shades and the bright, even light.', '2009-02-24 23:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273140, 766621, 12733, '<td valign="top">The pathways really hold the picture together and guide the eye through it. Are the colors really this pastel?</td>', 'The pathways really hold the picture together and guide the eye through it. Are the colors really this pastel?', '2009-02-24 23:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273143, 767431, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sunken house is interesting, but disturbing for a calendar type photo. The snow certainly says January.</td>', 'The sunken house is interesting, but disturbing for a calendar type photo. The snow certainly says January.', '2009-02-24 23:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273148, 766841, 12733, '<td valign="top">What an interesting complex of buildings. Looks like something M.C. Escher would conceive. Nice clear rendition.</td>', 'What an interesting complex of buildings. Looks like something M.C. Escher would conceive. Nice clear rendition.', '2009-02-24 23:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273573, 767051, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty image though it makes me think more of April than March</td>', 'Pretty image though it makes me think more of April than March', '2009-02-25 01:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273579, 767520, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the slow shutter speed effect, just not crazy about the pp. To me it appears too contrasty, and over sharpened.</td>', 'I like the slow shutter speed effect, just not crazy about the pp. To me it appears too contrasty, and over sharpened.', '2009-02-25 01:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273582, 766739, 37252, '<td valign="top">what a funny expression on his/her face. lol</td>', 'what a funny expression on his/her face. lol', '2009-02-25 01:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273590, 767601, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really do not care for the halo along the top of the trees</td>', 'I really do not care for the halo along the top of the trees', '2009-02-25 01:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273591, 767449, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot!', '2009-02-25 01:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273592, 767184, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal and perfect DOF</td>', 'Beautiful animal and perfect DOF', '2009-02-25 01:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273595, 767013, 37252, '<td valign="top">Harsh editing here. The reds are over saturated in my opinion. I do like the composition / perspective.</td>', 'Harsh editing here. The reds are over saturated in my opinion. I do like the composition / perspective.', '2009-02-25 01:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273598, 767605, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice image aside from the wrinkled background with some fold lines too. I find them distracting features to the background. I''m not sure how the dead bird fits in, but that doesn''t bother me nearly as much as the fold lines.</td>', 'Nice image aside from the wrinkled background with some fold lines too. I find them distracting features to the background. I''m not sure how the dead bird fits in, but that doesn''t bother me nearly as much as the fold lines.', '2009-02-25 01:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273601, 767096, 37252, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2009-02-25 01:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273603, 767591, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition</td>', 'Very nice composition', '2009-02-25 01:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273606, 767550, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like the tonal range here, and the crispness of the image. Very well done.</td>', 'I really like the tonal range here, and the crispness of the image. Very well done.', '2009-02-25 02:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273609, 767361, 37252, '<td valign="top">Perfect colors for the month of October</td>', 'Perfect colors for the month of October', '2009-02-25 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273610, 766956, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sweet macro!!!</td>', 'Sweet macro!!!', '2009-02-25 02:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273612, 767342, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love the feeling of water movement here. The colors are also very pleasing to look at.</td>', 'I love the feeling of water movement here. The colors are also very pleasing to look at.', '2009-02-25 02:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273617, 767598, 37252, '<td valign="top">appears a bit over sharpened</td>', 'appears a bit over sharpened', '2009-02-25 02:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273620, 767338, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - very good DOF - but highly over saturated.</td>', 'Nice capture - very good DOF - but highly over saturated.', '2009-02-25 02:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273630, 767413, 37252, '<td valign="top">A true treasure</td>', 'A true treasure', '2009-02-25 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273695, 767575, 49109, '<td valign="top">I can imagine this as Posthumous'' shot. A bit late for the apple challenge? Anyway, great subject, but lighting could be enhanced. Bumping you slightly up to 7.</td>', 'I can imagine this as Posthumous'' shot. A bit late for the apple challenge? Anyway, great subject, but lighting could be enhanced. Bumping you slightly up to 7.', '2009-02-25 03:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273708, 767413, 88718, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours but a rather confused composition</td>', 'Lovely colours but a rather confused composition', '2009-02-25 04:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273712, 766020, 88718, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Only the choice of the colour of the model''s top seems to shout against the diagonal of the flowers-face. An alternative colour would have been better. Not sure which.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Only the choice of the colour of the model''s top seems to shout against the diagonal of the flowers-face. An alternative colour would have been better. Not sure which.', '2009-02-25 04:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273716, 765843, 88718, '<td valign="top">Love the background. The focus could have been a little more central on the petals bbut an overall nice photo.</td>', 'Love the background. The focus could have been a little more central on the petals bbut an overall nice photo.', '2009-02-25 04:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273717, 766882, 88718, '<td valign="top">A real riot of colour. Busy but nice.</td>', 'A real riot of colour. Busy but nice.', '2009-02-25 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273719, 767422, 88718, '<td valign="top">I assume HDR. A bit too harsh on the tone mapping for my taste. Would be interesting if you could bring the boat back and just push the background. The coloured fringing around the boat is not very attractive</td>', 'I assume HDR. A bit too harsh on the tone mapping for my taste. Would be interesting if you could bring the boat back and just push the background. The coloured fringing around the boat is not very attractive', '2009-02-25 04:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273759, 767529, 73873, '<td valign="top">A little more vibrancy/saturation would work wonders here bringing out the colour of the sky</td>', 'A little more vibrancy/saturation would work wonders here bringing out the colour of the sky', '2009-02-25 05:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273782, 766115, 104220, '<td valign="top">I Like this one, a lot....!!!</td>', 'I Like this one, a lot....!!!', '2009-02-25 05:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5273786, 767559, 104220, '<td valign="top">Timeless...</td>', 'Timeless...', '2009-02-25 05:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
