(5274402, 767550, 103142, '<td valign="top">fun shot- Makes you feel cold.</td>', 'fun shot- Makes you feel cold.', '2009-02-25 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274405, 767534, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice capture.</td>', 'nice capture.', '2009-02-25 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274408, 767219, 103142, '<td valign="top">fun scene. Seems a little over-saturated.</td>', 'fun scene. Seems a little over-saturated.', '2009-02-25 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274409, 767427, 103142, '<td valign="top">ooh! nice shot. Wish I was there.</td>', 'ooh! nice shot. Wish I was there.', '2009-02-25 13:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274433, 767480, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the ice, but I''m afraid the shot doesn''t resonate with me. I would have like the ice on something a little more interesting...</td>', 'I like the ice, but I''m afraid the shot doesn''t resonate with me. I would have like the ice on something a little more interesting...', '2009-02-25 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274434, 766880, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very lovely! One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very lovely! One of my favorites so far.', '2009-02-25 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274435, 767415, 103142, '<td valign="top">wonderful!</td>', 'wonderful!', '2009-02-25 13:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274441, 767507, 103142, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be anything tying it to a calendar, not even a month name. But I''m not rating it down for that. I just think the angle makes her face look strangely out of proportion and the black shadows/smudges on her face, especially below the mouth makes it look like dirt. I''m sorry, doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be anything tying it to a calendar, not even a month name. But I''m not rating it down for that. I just think the angle makes her face look strangely out of proportion and the black shadows/smudges on her face, especially below the mouth makes it look like dirt. I''m sorry, doesn''t work for me.', '2009-02-25 13:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274479, 767430, 99263, '<td valign="top">A stunner of a shot. Beautifully composed, nice crisp detail and lovely dewy-fresh colors. 8</td>', 'A stunner of a shot. Beautifully composed, nice crisp detail and lovely dewy-fresh colors. 8', '2009-02-25 13:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274483, 766882, 99263, '<td valign="top">A brilliantly executed bouquet of flowers. Dazzling array of colors. Has a painting like quality to it. 8</td>', 'A brilliantly executed bouquet of flowers. Dazzling array of colors. Has a painting like quality to it. 8', '2009-02-25 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274485, 767449, 99263, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image and beautifully executed. 8</td>', 'Fascinating image and beautifully executed. 8', '2009-02-25 13:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274486, 767468, 99263, '<td valign="top">Stunningly executed. Absolutely lovely. 7</td>', 'Stunningly executed. Absolutely lovely. 7', '2009-02-25 13:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274488, 767571, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, super smooth skin tones. 7</td>', 'Great portrait, super smooth skin tones. 7', '2009-02-25 13:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274490, 767184, 99263, '<td valign="top">Superb wolf shot with wonderful detail. 9</td>', 'Superb wolf shot with wonderful detail. 9', '2009-02-25 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274493, 766956, 99263, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Lovely detail and bokeh 9</td>', 'Excellent shot. Lovely detail and bokeh 9', '2009-02-25 13:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274496, 767594, 99263, '<td valign="top">Superb. I love the soft smooth tones and lighting. 8</td>', 'Superb. I love the soft smooth tones and lighting. 8', '2009-02-25 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274501, 767451, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Beautiful the way the flower is reflected as a perfect miniature in each of the dewdrops in varying sizes.  8</td>', 'Wonderful image. Beautiful the way the flower is reflected as a perfect miniature in each of the dewdrops in varying sizes.  8', '2009-02-25 13:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274504, 766076, 99263, '<td valign="top">Superb macro with excellent detail. 8</td>', 'Superb macro with excellent detail. 8', '2009-02-25 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274508, 767605, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely rendering. Simple but very appealing with excellent detail, texture and lighting. 8</td>', 'Lovely rendering. Simple but very appealing with excellent detail, texture and lighting. 8', '2009-02-25 13:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274643, 766115, 84124, '<td valign="top">I''ll have my right sneaker for dinner if this isn''t Enzo!  Great shot, will easily be top 10.</td>', 'I''ll have my right sneaker for dinner if this isn''t Enzo!  Great shot, will easily be top 10.', '2009-02-25 14:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274755, 766228, 75585, '<td valign="top">Finally - a picture that is phenomenally executed and has a appropriate month.  Red October - totally get it!</td>', 'Finally - a picture that is phenomenally executed and has a appropriate month.  Red October - totally get it!', '2009-02-25 16:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274763, 766115, 75585, '<td valign="top">I LOVE that jet entrail on the left</td>', 'I LOVE that jet entrail on the left', '2009-02-25 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274766, 767185, 75585, '<td valign="top">First of - nice shot!  To me this says a Spring Month (April/May) when new life springs forth - but not a big deal as I am voting on the merits of the shot and this is nicely done</td>', 'First of - nice shot!  To me this says a Spring Month (April/May) when new life springs forth - but not a big deal as I am voting on the merits of the shot and this is nicely done', '2009-02-25 16:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274772, 767451, 75585, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2009-02-25 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274835, 766882, 102024, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice but there is some serious artifacting and pixellation going on here...</td>', 'The colors are nice but there is some serious artifacting and pixellation going on here...', '2009-02-25 16:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274839, 767508, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  I like the cleanliness of the baseball (minus that mark on the bottom).  I can almost smell the leather of the glove.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  I like the cleanliness of the baseball (minus that mark on the bottom).  I can almost smell the leather of the glove.', '2009-02-25 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274844, 767096, 102024, '<td valign="top">A tad bit washed out...  Not a good balance of lights and darks which I don''t think really help this photo.</td>', 'A tad bit washed out...  Not a good balance of lights and darks which I don''t think really help this photo.', '2009-02-25 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274848, 767521, 102024, '<td valign="top">There are some strong elements in this scene, but I think that the lower half is too cluttered and takes away from the flow of the composition.</td>', 'There are some strong elements in this scene, but I think that the lower half is too cluttered and takes away from the flow of the composition.', '2009-02-25 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274852, 767413, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well... I think the tight crop kinda works here, but I''m not too sure about the leaf itself... I don''t know... something about it makes me wish it were shaped differently in the frame...</td>', 'Well... I think the tight crop kinda works here, but I''m not too sure about the leaf itself... I don''t know... something about it makes me wish it were shaped differently in the frame...', '2009-02-25 16:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274856, 766956, 75585, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot - doesn''t remotely say February to me at all.  But I didn''t let that affect my vote</td>', 'GREAT shot - doesn''t remotely say February to me at all.  But I didn''t let that affect my vote', '2009-02-25 17:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274857, 766519, 102024, '<td valign="top">I think the post-processing on this works much better with the middle and background more so than with the tree branches.  While they work compositionally, I think they are rather distracting the way there were processed.</td>', 'I think the post-processing on this works much better with the middle and background more so than with the tree branches.  While they work compositionally, I think they are rather distracting the way there were processed.', '2009-02-25 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274865, 767605, 102024, '<td valign="top">Is that a dead bird?  A little morbid for a calendar, I''d think...  Not really sure I see "November" here, and the choice of lighting is interesting.  I think that fold in the fabric in the background is rather distracting.</td>', 'Is that a dead bird?  A little morbid for a calendar, I''d think...  Not really sure I see "November" here, and the choice of lighting is interesting.  I think that fold in the fabric in the background is rather distracting.', '2009-02-25 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274866, 767360, 75585, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of April showers</td>', 'This makes me think of April showers', '2009-02-25 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274868, 767601, 102024, '<td valign="top">Too much post-processing for my taste.</td>', 'Too much post-processing for my taste.', '2009-02-25 17:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274869, 766076, 75585, '<td valign="top">Yikes!!</td>', 'Yikes!!', '2009-02-25 17:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274871, 767013, 102024, '<td valign="top">This is very red.  Almost TOO red.  I like the detail in the flower petals.</td>', 'This is very red.  Almost TOO red.  I like the detail in the flower petals.', '2009-02-25 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274873, 766839, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the geometry of this image.  Strong, yet contemplative.  Not sure I''d put this in my calendar though...</td>', 'I like the geometry of this image.  Strong, yet contemplative.  Not sure I''d put this in my calendar though...', '2009-02-25 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274878, 767526, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred it without the splash--makes my eyes wander a little too much. I really like the daffodil.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred it without the splash--makes my eyes wander a little too much. I really like the daffodil.', '2009-02-25 17:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274879, 767216, 102024, '<td valign="top">Interesting in execution, but I think this image can only really be taken at face value (which isn''t necessarily a bad thing).</td>', 'Interesting in execution, but I think this image can only really be taken at face value (which isn''t necessarily a bad thing).', '2009-02-25 17:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274880, 767517, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nicely done. I like it a lot.</td>', 'very nicely done. I like it a lot.', '2009-02-25 17:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274882, 767516, 102024, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked to see a wider view of this scene.  The bleed of grass to barn to sky is very nice.  I really like the overlapping elements.</td>', 'I think I would have liked to see a wider view of this scene.  The bleed of grass to barn to sky is very nice.  I really like the overlapping elements.', '2009-02-25 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274885, 767096, 75585, '<td valign="top">Yippee for you!!  Looks like it is tilting a little low on the right but still a great great shot (and it could so be my eyes so I''m not letting it affect my vote :-)</td>', 'Yippee for you!!  Looks like it is tilting a little low on the right but still a great great shot (and it could so be my eyes so I''m not letting it affect my vote :-)', '2009-02-25 17:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274886, 767593, 102024, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Great colors and detail.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Great colors and detail.', '2009-02-25 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274888, 767546, 102024, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think this may have been stronger without that evergreen branch in the top left.  I like that you''re attempting to break up the horizon line, but I think it just dominates the top half of the image too much to let the rest of it breathe.</td>', 'Actually, I think this may have been stronger without that evergreen branch in the top left.  I like that you''re attempting to break up the horizon line, but I think it just dominates the top half of the image too much to let the rest of it breathe.', '2009-02-25 17:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274891, 767446, 102024, '<td valign="top">There is space here for many interesting subtleties.  However, everything, for me, is lost on the composition.  Everything just seems out of place, the road winding on the left, the RV sitting in the center, the flag sitting at the edge of the frame...</td>', 'There is space here for many interesting subtleties.  However, everything, for me, is lost on the composition.  Everything just seems out of place, the road winding on the left, the RV sitting in the center, the flag sitting at the edge of the frame...', '2009-02-25 17:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274893, 766509, 102024, '<td valign="top">I would almost like to see this with greater contrast to really bring out the richness in the silhouettes.... and perhaps a little more treatment of the clouds in the sky... the colors in it really flatten it out.</td>', 'I would almost like to see this with greater contrast to really bring out the richness in the silhouettes.... and perhaps a little more treatment of the clouds in the sky... the colors in it really flatten it out.', '2009-02-25 17:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274898, 767427, 102024, '<td valign="top">I love the treatment of the sky.  The silhouette of the tree on the left is beautiful against the rays of light surrounding it.  The trees on the right of the frame break up the horizon line and bring a more dynamic element to this deceptively calm scene.</td>', 'I love the treatment of the sky.  The silhouette of the tree on the left is beautiful against the rays of light surrounding it.  The trees on the right of the frame break up the horizon line and bring a more dynamic element to this deceptively calm scene.', '2009-02-25 17:14:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5274901, 766880, 102024, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture of the fog/mist.  The faded trees in the background give extra depth that I think would otherwise be lost in the strength of the foreground and reflections.  However, I think this leaves a lot to be desired as far as composition goes.</td>', 'A very nice capture of the fog/mist.  The faded trees in the background give extra depth that I think would otherwise be lost in the strength of the foreground and reflections.  However, I think this leaves a lot to be desired as far as composition goes.', '2009-02-25 17:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274910, 767232, 102024, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition (not sure how I feel about it yet), and I can really feel the warmth of the sunlight peeking around the trees.  I don''t know, this is almost too yellow/golden for me... I understand it adds to the warmth but I think it could be toned down just a tad to balance it out but still leave a sense of warmth.</td>', 'An interesting composition (not sure how I feel about it yet), and I can really feel the warmth of the sunlight peeking around the trees.  I don''t know, this is almost too yellow/golden for me... I understand it adds to the warmth but I think it could be toned down just a tad to balance it out but still leave a sense of warmth.', '2009-02-25 17:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274912, 767569, 102024, '<td valign="top">This is probably just because of location, but I wish January looked like this here.  It''s usually replaced with about 5 feet of snow and boring smooth overcast skies.  I like the dynamics in the clouds, though I think they could be doing more... not like that is in your control though.  The livestock is barely hanging onto the frame... but that doesn''t really bother me too much.  I would really like to have seen something breaking the horizon line into the sky because they are really two separate elements here.  There is a hint of something in the background but it is easily dismissed.</td>', 'This is probably just because of location, but I wish January looked like this here.  It''s usually replaced with about 5 feet of snow and boring smooth overcast skies.  I like the dynamics in the clouds, though I think they could be doing more... not like that is in your control though.  The livestock is barely hanging onto the frame... but that doesn''t really bother me too much.  I would really like to have seen something breaking the horizon line into the sky because they are really two separate elements here.  There is a hint of something in the background but it is easily dismissed.', '2009-02-25 17:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274913, 767404, 102024, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, there isn''t really anything that stands out, in my opinion.  I like the treatment of the background with the vertical lines leading you through the frame, broken up by the foreground.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, there isn''t really anything that stands out, in my opinion.  I like the treatment of the background with the vertical lines leading you through the frame, broken up by the foreground.', '2009-02-25 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274917, 767538, 102024, '<td valign="top">Dang, is that a wedding ring or a wedding bracelet??  Interesting idea but I''m not really sure I like the composition.  Perhaps if his arm were extended a little more?</td>', 'Dang, is that a wedding ring or a wedding bracelet??  Interesting idea but I''m not really sure I like the composition.  Perhaps if his arm were extended a little more?', '2009-02-25 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274920, 766057, 102024, '<td valign="top">Everything in this image feels light.  The barn seems like it''s trying to exit the frame but just didn''t make it.  Not really sure this is working for me compositionally.</td>', 'Everything in this image feels light.  The barn seems like it''s trying to exit the frame but just didn''t make it.  Not really sure this is working for me compositionally.', '2009-02-25 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274922, 766854, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmm.... well the post processing actually kinda works here.  I like the way it has brought out the details in the foreground while the treatment of colors is somewhat vague.  I can almost hear the wind blowing...</td>', 'Hmm.... well the post processing actually kinda works here.  I like the way it has brought out the details in the foreground while the treatment of colors is somewhat vague.  I can almost hear the wind blowing...', '2009-02-25 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274925, 767594, 102024, '<td valign="top">A nice picture of a pitcher of flowers.  Well composed... The green background is... okay.  Decent lighting.</td>', 'A nice picture of a pitcher of flowers.  Well composed... The green background is... okay.  Decent lighting.', '2009-02-25 17:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274927, 765962, 102024, '<td valign="top">For a shot that''s been done over and over on this site, I would like to have seen some more stark black in the heart shadow.  The book pages are well light, and I like the diagonal lines... but there is some noise in this photo that I''m not sure really helps the image...</td>', 'For a shot that''s been done over and over on this site, I would like to have seen some more stark black in the heart shadow.  The book pages are well light, and I like the diagonal lines... but there is some noise in this photo that I''m not sure really helps the image...', '2009-02-25 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274934, 767399, 102024, '<td valign="top">Considering the orientation of this image, I would have liked to see, perhaps, a deeper DOF.</td>', 'Considering the orientation of this image, I would have liked to see, perhaps, a deeper DOF.', '2009-02-25 17:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274939, 767507, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmm... what month is this supposed to be for?  The post processing on this is wayyyy too overdone for my taste.</td>', 'Hmm... what month is this supposed to be for?  The post processing on this is wayyyy too overdone for my taste.', '2009-02-25 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274950, 767480, 102024, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, this is actually working quite well.  However, I think that the subject is just rather bland...</td>', 'Compositionally, this is actually working quite well.  However, I think that the subject is just rather bland...', '2009-02-25 17:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274953, 767149, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  The elements of this image work together nicely.  But the colors are rather flat, and the DOF is rather shallow for such a landscape shot.</td>', 'Well composed.  The elements of this image work together nicely.  But the colors are rather flat, and the DOF is rather shallow for such a landscape shot.', '2009-02-25 17:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274958, 767067, 102024, '<td valign="top">The definition in the water is spectacular.  The lighting is almost perfect.  The figure is well placed in this composition.  There is such power emanating from this image.  I love the colors.</td>', 'The definition in the water is spectacular.  The lighting is almost perfect.  The figure is well placed in this composition.  There is such power emanating from this image.  I love the colors.', '2009-02-25 17:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
