(5275699, 767571, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very cute and a nice shot. Good idea with the heart. It seems to me that the heart might be more in focus than the model. Could have been planned this way but I would have scored it one point higher had it been in focus. The soft focus does look good. But not as good when other parts in the picture does not have the soft focus.<br/>Overall a good job! 6</td>', 'Very cute and a nice shot. Good idea with the heart. It seems to me that the heart might be more in focus than the model. Could have been planned this way but I would have scored it one point higher had it been in focus. The soft focus does look good. But not as good when other parts in the picture does not have the soft focus.Overall a good job! 6', '2009-02-26 08:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
