(5276820, 766228, 74979, '<td valign="top">feels like fall, foliage and specifically October, given the heavy dose of oranges in your sky..perhaps just a tad too heavy with the saturation, at least how it looks on my monitor</td>', 'feels like fall, foliage and specifically October, given the heavy dose of oranges in your sky..perhaps just a tad too heavy with the saturation, at least how it looks on my monitor', '2009-02-26 19:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
