(5278475, 766876, 103142, '<td valign="top">fun idea, falls a little flat to me, however.</td>', 'fun idea, falls a little flat to me, however.', '2009-02-27 21:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278477, 767481, 103142, '<td valign="top">nicely arranged backdrop.</td>', 'nicely arranged backdrop.', '2009-02-27 21:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278478, 767005, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. Haven''t seen a full rainbow in a long time.</td>', 'Very lovely. Haven''t seen a full rainbow in a long time.', '2009-02-27 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278481, 767220, 103142, '<td valign="top">I adore the reflection--I would have cropped it in a little from the left. there''s a lot of space here, and it doesn''t add anything to the image.</td>', 'I adore the reflection--I would have cropped it in a little from the left. there''s a lot of space here, and it doesn''t add anything to the image.', '2009-02-27 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278485, 766934, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Very small suggestion--I don''t know if it would have been possible to include a little space at the top of the building in the reflection. Either that or cut off part of the top. Having it end perfectly at the edge of the reflection is not quite as strong. Didn''t affect my voting--just a thought.</td>', 'Very nice. Very small suggestion--I don''t know if it would have been possible to include a little space at the top of the building in the reflection. Either that or cut off part of the top. Having it end perfectly at the edge of the reflection is not quite as strong. Didn''t affect my voting--just a thought.', '2009-02-27 21:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278486, 767523, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what the water drop has to do with August, but it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Not quite sure what the water drop has to do with August, but it''s a nice shot.', '2009-02-27 21:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278487, 767079, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun picture! I like it.</td>', 'Fun picture! I like it.', '2009-02-27 21:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278491, 767560, 103142, '<td valign="top">Restful shot, very pretty, but not very inspiring. I''d actually like it better without the splash on the rock. The more I look at it, the more peaceful it seems. The splash doesn''t add to it. (only mentioned it, because I have a tendency to take at least 5 of the same shot, and you might have one without the splash.)</td>', 'Restful shot, very pretty, but not very inspiring. I''d actually like it better without the splash on the rock. The more I look at it, the more peaceful it seems. The splash doesn''t add to it. (only mentioned it, because I have a tendency to take at least 5 of the same shot, and you might have one without the splash.)', '2009-02-27 21:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278492, 767050, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2009-02-27 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278494, 767574, 103142, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. Would have liked a little more of the water in the foreground. It makes a interesting diagonal that gets a little lost at the bottom.</td>', 'Pretty shot. Would have liked a little more of the water in the foreground. It makes a interesting diagonal that gets a little lost at the bottom.', '2009-02-27 21:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278496, 767429, 103142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunsets! We don''t get skies like that in Virginia. :(</td>', 'Beautiful sunsets! We don''t get skies like that in Virginia. :(', '2009-02-27 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278499, 767575, 30364, '<td valign="top">I suppose I should make a wisecrack about the "bottom of the barrel", but that would be unworthy because this is unquestionably the best entry.  I thought briefly of Mt Rushmore, but it''s better than that (if on a less heroic scale).  Perhaps <i>The Scream</i> is closer to the mark?  Or it could be Count Orlok, I suppose.  Whoever it is, it''s going to keep the doctor away.  I know I''ll not feel comfortable biting into a pippin for a while.</td>', 'I suppose I should make a wisecrack about the "bottom of the barrel", but that would be unworthy because this is unquestionably the best entry.  I thought briefly of Mt Rushmore, but it''s better than that (if on a less heroic scale).  Perhaps The Scream is closer to the mark?  Or it could be Count Orlok, I suppose.  Whoever it is, it''s going to keep the doctor away.  I know I''ll not feel comfortable biting into a pippin for a while.', '2009-02-27 21:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278502, 767504, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is ridiculous.  I love it!</td>', 'This is ridiculous.  I love it!', '2009-02-27 21:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278505, 767079, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  And the longer I look the lovelier it becomes.</td>', 'Lovely.  And the longer I look the lovelier it becomes.', '2009-02-27 21:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
