(5278533, 766641, 99412, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a little place in Tumwater canyon just west of the town of Leavenworth Washington. It looks just like it. It''s quite a sight during spawning season When the Salmon are trying to make it up river to calmer waters to lay their eggs. <br/>Nice photo.<br/>:)</td>', 'Reminds me of a little place in Tumwater canyon just west of the town of Leavenworth Washington. It looks just like it. It''s quite a sight during spawning season When the Salmon are trying to make it up river to calmer waters to lay their eggs. Nice photo.:)', '2009-02-27 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
