(5278758, 765938, 88247, '<td valign="top">A great shot and such sweet,loving expressions on their cute little faces:-)<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'A great shot and such sweet,loving expressions on their cute little faces:-)Good luck.', '2009-02-28 04:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278763, 767185, 88247, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot;-)<br/>So sweet and innocent.<br/>What a lovely portrait keepsake.<br/>My favourite of favourites in this challenge.<br/>Good luck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-02 02:10:59.</i></td>', 'I just love this shot;-)So sweet and innocent.What a lovely portrait keepsake.My favourite of favourites in this challenge.Good luck.', '2009-02-28 04:23:41.000000', '2009-03-02 02:10:59.000000', 1),
(5278846, 766972, 43191, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2009-02-28 08:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278848, 767468, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the angle of the flower. FYI- did you know that you can remove the brown pollen bits? If you pull them off, the flower actually will survive longer, and you end up with an even softer light on white image. (didn''t affect my vote, obviously, I used to work at a flower shop--and I always remove these to make them last longer. be careful, though, the pollen stains.)</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the angle of the flower. FYI- did you know that you can remove the brown pollen bits? If you pull them off, the flower actually will survive longer, and you end up with an even softer light on white image. (didn''t affect my vote, obviously, I used to work at a flower shop--and I always remove these to make them last longer. be careful, though, the pollen stains.)', '2009-02-28 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278849, 766115, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the contrail. I''m afraid that people might not appreciate it, but I do!</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the contrail. I''m afraid that people might not appreciate it, but I do!', '2009-02-28 08:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278850, 767013, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice lighting on the rose. I would have bent the flower in the lower left so that it was out of the frame. I tends to draw your eye. Anyway, the lighting is very nice--it give nice detail to the flower.</td>', 'nice lighting on the rose. I would have bent the flower in the lower left so that it was out of the frame. I tends to draw your eye. Anyway, the lighting is very nice--it give nice detail to the flower.', '2009-02-28 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278853, 766688, 103142, '<td valign="top">fascinating area! I''m not sure the foreground adds much, the rest was wonderful, and I''d like a little more depth of field. The cliffs in the background are wonderful--it would be nice to have them a little sharper.</td>', 'fascinating area! I''m not sure the foreground adds much, the rest was wonderful, and I''d like a little more depth of field. The cliffs in the background are wonderful--it would be nice to have them a little sharper.', '2009-02-28 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278876, 766057, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors and warm lighting, strong rule of thirds composition. Well done.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors and warm lighting, strong rule of thirds composition. Well done.', '2009-02-28 09:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278880, 767429, 90414, '<td valign="top">The foreground does little to add to the composition (for me, anyway) except to keep the elements in the rule of thirds placement. The sand could be cropped out entirely imo, or else shoot from a lower perspective near the flowering plants at lower left. The clouds and colors are wonderful.</td>', 'The foreground does little to add to the composition (for me, anyway) except to keep the elements in the rule of thirds placement. The sand could be cropped out entirely imo, or else shoot from a lower perspective near the flowering plants at lower left. The clouds and colors are wonderful.', '2009-02-28 09:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278883, 767219, 90414, '<td valign="top">VERY warm colors, either perfect sunset timing or well saturated in pp. Love the reflection.</td>', 'VERY warm colors, either perfect sunset timing or well saturated in pp. Love the reflection.', '2009-02-28 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278884, 767292, 90414, '<td valign="top">Very Norman Rockwell... great pastel shades and composition.</td>', 'Very Norman Rockwell... great pastel shades and composition.', '2009-02-28 09:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278887, 767170, 90414, '<td valign="top">You''ve lost detail in the whites. Adjust your exposure compensation when shooting very light or dark objects. Using levels or shadow/highlights may get some detail back.</td>', 'You''ve lost detail in the whites. Adjust your exposure compensation when shooting very light or dark objects. Using levels or shadow/highlights may get some detail back.', '2009-02-28 09:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278907, 767427, 104315, '<td valign="top">I like how soft this photo looks.</td>', 'I like how soft this photo looks.', '2009-02-28 10:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278940, 767415, 102024, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Perfect for my calendar!</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Perfect for my calendar!', '2009-02-28 10:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278943, 767029, 102024, '<td valign="top">Wow... this image is crazy.  It''s like... watching someone get electrocuted.  Good job... but I probably wouldn''t want it in my calendar...</td>', 'Wow... this image is crazy.  It''s like... watching someone get electrocuted.  Good job... but I probably wouldn''t want it in my calendar...', '2009-02-28 10:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278944, 767060, 102024, '<td valign="top">The crop feels a little tight here... the rabbit needs to breathe...</td>', 'The crop feels a little tight here... the rabbit needs to breathe...', '2009-02-28 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278949, 766115, 102024, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that steam coming off the buildings?  I don''t think I could believe this is July, but it is a very nice cityscape.  The color treatment is nice (but kinda adds to the cold feel of it...)</td>', 'Isn''t that steam coming off the buildings?  I don''t think I could believe this is July, but it is a very nice cityscape.  The color treatment is nice (but kinda adds to the cold feel of it...)', '2009-02-28 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278950, 767144, 102024, '<td valign="top">The pinks are a little too over powering here.</td>', 'The pinks are a little too over powering here.', '2009-02-28 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278955, 767479, 102024, '<td valign="top">I love the organic warmth emanating from this image.  It evokes such tenderness...  I like it!  Though I think it may look better without the green line at the bottom.</td>', 'I love the organic warmth emanating from this image.  It evokes such tenderness...  I like it!  Though I think it may look better without the green line at the bottom.', '2009-02-28 11:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278956, 766752, 102024, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is really harsh and the black background behind the flowers and ball is distracting... perhaps if it were green or blue or a more organic color...</td>', 'The lighting here is really harsh and the black background behind the flowers and ball is distracting... perhaps if it were green or blue or a more organic color...', '2009-02-28 11:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278960, 767505, 102024, '<td valign="top">The landscape feels a little cut out of this picture.  Perhaps you were cropping something out of the image, but I feel that there could definitely be more of the land in this image.</td>', 'The landscape feels a little cut out of this picture.  Perhaps you were cropping something out of the image, but I feel that there could definitely be more of the land in this image.', '2009-02-28 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278961, 767610, 102024, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t seem very natural.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t seem very natural.', '2009-02-28 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 1);
