(5282563, 767608, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave your entry a 5. I could not think at the time why it did not rate higher with me, so I left a flip comment instead. Looking at it again, I think it is the close crop. The model is too close to he edge of the frame and the corner of the car seems abruptly cut off. The tilt might be an issue as well, though I didn''t pay attention to that at the time of voting.</td>', 'I gave your entry a 5. I could not think at the time why it did not rate higher with me, so I left a flip comment instead. Looking at it again, I think it is the close crop. The model is too close to he edge of the frame and the corner of the car seems abruptly cut off. The tilt might be an issue as well, though I didn''t pay attention to that at the time of voting.', '2009-03-02 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
