(5283188, 767226, 95579, '<td valign="top">Didnt vote on this challenge as I was in it but I would give this at least a 6 and then maybe a bump after looking at it a few days!<br/>Love the sky and the city in the distance. The lines of the tracks are really cool &amp; I love the perspective.<br/>Its one of those shots that grows on you the more you look at it so maybe thats why it didnt do as well as it could have done<br/>(''scuse the ramble I only meant to put a brief comment!)</td>', 'Didnt vote on this challenge as I was in it but I would give this at least a 6 and then maybe a bump after looking at it a few days!Love the sky and the city in the distance. The lines of the tracks are really cool & I love the perspective.Its one of those shots that grows on you the more you look at it so maybe thats why it didnt do as well as it could have done(''scuse the ramble I only meant to put a brief comment!)', '2009-03-02 09:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5283207, 766972, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Terry ... love the texture on the water.   Big congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'Nice shot Terry ... love the texture on the water.   Big congrats on the top 10!', '2009-03-02 09:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5283215, 767079, 61651, '<td valign="top">The way the two blooms are seemingly yanked in opposite directions gives this shot an emotional punch of estrangement, amid all that tumult in the background patterning.  I fear for the survival of each of them.  Good way to use contradicting directions in a composition to give it unsettling energy.</td>', 'The way the two blooms are seemingly yanked in opposite directions gives this shot an emotional punch of estrangement, amid all that tumult in the background patterning.  I fear for the survival of each of them.  Good way to use contradicting directions in a composition to give it unsettling energy.', '2009-03-02 09:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5283217, 767029, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cool shadows ... I''m surprised this one didn''t do better.  There''s a lot of chaotic depth to this image.</td>', 'Cool shadows ... I''m surprised this one didn''t do better.  There''s a lot of chaotic depth to this image.', '2009-03-02 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5283237, 767231, 61961, '<td valign="top">Conceptually, I couldn''t care less about what month this is supposed to be, but to me it doesn''t look like a calendar entry, it looks like a nice photo from a family album.  Maybe more visual context would have helped set the scene and explained the makeup.  <br/>Technically I''m surprised no one has mentioned the lack of sharpness, especially noticeable in the eyes.  Detail can be lost when resizing, so a little USM (unsharp mask) adjustment can help.  Btw, I agree with others that the person in the background is eye-catching, despite the blur.</td>', 'Conceptually, I couldn''t care less about what month this is supposed to be, but to me it doesn''t look like a calendar entry, it looks like a nice photo from a family album.  Maybe more visual context would have helped set the scene and explained the makeup.  Technically I''m surprised no one has mentioned the lack of sharpness, especially noticeable in the eyes.  Detail can be lost when resizing, so a little USM (unsharp mask) adjustment can help.  Btw, I agree with others that the person in the background is eye-catching, despite the blur.', '2009-03-02 09:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5283245, 766934, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good finish. You''ve had an amazing year so far. Keep it up!</td>', 'Good finish. You''ve had an amazing year so far. Keep it up!', '2009-03-02 09:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
