(5283687, 766956, 52549, '<td valign="top">I''ll go with Sandy on this. I''d buy any macro calender you brought out and I love this shot, Roz. It''s another example of your most excellent work.</td>', 'I''ll go with Sandy on this. I''d buy any macro calender you brought out and I love this shot, Roz. It''s another example of your most excellent work.', '2009-03-02 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
