(5283975, 766115, 68599, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jlanoue:</b></div><hr/><i> Great... I''ve heard footware is actually quite tasty when boiled for 30 minutes, steamed lightly in h20/olive oil and delicately spiced... congrats on the great finish and being compared to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a>, it''s a hell of a compliment in my book!  This was my pick for the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i didn''t think this was hotpasta just cause I knew this was Toronto. <br/> <br/>Great photograph!</td>', 'Originally posted by jlanoue: Great... I''ve heard footware is actually quite tasty when boiled for 30 minutes, steamed lightly in h20/olive oil and delicately spiced... congrats on the great finish and being compared to  hotpasta, it''s a hell of a compliment in my book!  This was my pick for the blue.   i didn''t think this was hotpasta just cause I knew this was Toronto.  Great photograph!', '2009-03-02 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
