(5366159, 766372, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good idea for a calendar, actually!  This scored pretty well (in my book, anything over 5.5 is "well") and may have scored even better had your background been a lighter color or had you used a more squarish crop.  There appears to be a reflection, but it''s somewhat muddied in nature and detracts a bit rather than supports the shot - does that make sense?  Darn perfect rose, I might add.</td>', 'Very good idea for a calendar, actually!  This scored pretty well (in my book, anything over 5.5 is "well") and may have scored even better had your background been a lighter color or had you used a more squarish crop.  There appears to be a reflection, but it''s somewhat muddied in nature and detracts a bit rather than supports the shot - does that make sense?  Darn perfect rose, I might add.', '2009-03-15 17:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5366254, 766372, 12250, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the honest critique.  <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Very good idea for a calendar, actually!  This scored pretty well (in my book, anything over 5.5 is "well") and may have scored even better had your background been a lighter color or had you used a more squarish crop.  There appears to be a reflection, but it''s somewhat muddied in nature and detracts a bit rather than supports the shot - does that make sense?  Darn perfect rose, I might add. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thank you for the honest critique.  Originally posted by Melethia: Very good idea for a calendar, actually!  This scored pretty well (in my book, anything over 5.5 is "well") and may have scored even better had your background been a lighter color or had you used a more squarish crop.  There appears to be a reflection, but it''s somewhat muddied in nature and detracts a bit rather than supports the shot - does that make sense?  Darn perfect rose, I might add. ', '2009-03-15 17:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5384375, 766560, 23484, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh....winter in Michigan, gotta love it. I think this is a cool shot. I like the clouds.</td>', 'Ahhhh....winter in Michigan, gotta love it. I think this is a cool shot. I like the clouds.', '2009-03-17 15:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5408058, 767242, 96534, '<td valign="top">Hi, saw you were looking at why your shots aren''t ribboning, yet doing so well. And then saw that you''re struggling with composition. In my very humble opinion, those rocks in the foreground need to be further to the right, they''re too centred for my taste and don''t allow the eye to follow a natural plane. Lovely colours and textures though, great shot in general!</td>', 'Hi, saw you were looking at why your shots aren''t ribboning, yet doing so well. And then saw that you''re struggling with composition. In my very humble opinion, those rocks in the foreground need to be further to the right, they''re too centred for my taste and don''t allow the eye to follow a natural plane. Lovely colours and textures though, great shot in general!', '2009-03-30 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
